VALIDATION RULES
================================================================================

Document all field-level validation rules for all 3 modules in Application Analysis & Requirements.txt

Required rules:

Library Card Module ("Get a Library Card" form)

-First Name & Last Name: Non-empty text — no format or trim check
-Age: Non-empty text — NOT numeric-format-validated
-Email: Non-empty; type=email gives a browser-level check only
-Phone: Non-empty text — NOT digit-only or length-validated
-Role: One of Student / Employee must be selected AND the matching sub-field (School / Company) must be non-empty
-Action: Must select an option other than the default "Select"
-Amount: Read-only (disabled); auto-populated (apply=100, renewal=50) — not validated

Mandatory fields:6 of 8 inputs mandatory (all except Amount and the hidden non-selected work sub-field)

Services Module ("Ask a Librarian" form)

-Medium radio button: Must pick Email / Call / Chat first
-Call path: Shows phone details only — NO submit button, NO validation
-Email path — From: Non-empty — NO email-format check
-Email path — Query: Non-empty Chat path
-Name: Non-empty
-Chat path — Your Phone: Non-empty — NO digit-only check
-Chat path — Query: Non-empty

Membership Module

-Human verification:Drag the book image into the drop zone; the membership form is unreachable until this succeeds
-Tier radio: Gold or Platinum must be selected
-Card Number: Non-empty — NO format / length / checksum validation
-Amount: Read-only (Gold "Rs.5000" / Platinum "Rs.25000")

Also document any additional rules discovered during actual inspection.


